<title>CHINA: INDOSUEZ WI CARR SETS WARRANTS ON CHINA RESOURCES.</title>
<headline>INDOSUEZ WI CARR SETS WARRANTS ON CHINA RESOURCES.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indosuez W. I. Carr (Derivatives) Ltd said it launched 42 million American-style call warrants on China Resources Enterprises Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$34.92	PREMIUM	  23.80 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$1.311	GEARING	  2.96x</p>
<p> MATURITY	   13.AUG.98     BOARD LOT	20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	    HONG KONG     LISTING DATE   N/A</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE   HK$38.80	PAYMENT DATE   N/A</p>
<p>($1.00=HK$7.7433)</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
